L101:   show the efficacy of vitamin or antioxidant supplements in the prevention of the major cardiovascular events in subgroup meta-analysis by various factors. Overall, subgroup meta-analyses by type of supplement (table 2)  showed that there was no significant association between vitamin or antioxidant supplements and the risk of the major cardiovascular events (figs 3-6, 
